{
  "name": "hud",
  "version": "0.6.7",
  "author": {
    "name": "noaod"
  },
  "description": "One line above the prompt: context fill, rate-limit windows, a cache chip (кеш 59:48, m:ss) while the prompt cache is warm, and the buttons Handoff, Compact, Clear, Progress and a time/percent toggle; /hud with the figures as text, including cost and the full countdown.",
